    "long_instructions": "## **Plan a Movie Filter**\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Choose one filter to plan:\r\n\r\n   * **Comedy**\r\n   * **Recent Movies**\r\n   * **High Rated**\r\n\r\n2. Annotate one of the movie objects:\r\n\r\n   * Circle the **property** your filter will check.\r\n   * Underline the **value** your filter will compare.\r\n\r\n3. Decide: Should this movie be **Kept** or **Removed**?\r\n\r\n4. Write how your filter works in your own words.\r\n\r\n5. Complete the code condition for your filter:\r\n\r\n6. Save this sketch to your **Backpack**.\r\n\r\n",
